<title>UK: Credit Local sets 3.0 bln Ffr 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 3.0 bln Ffr 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    13.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.925   PAY DATE    13.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.35     SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    MGT/UND    0.3	 SELL CONC   1.575</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
